          "Grouping gives (x+{{c}})(x^3+{{n3}}).",
          "The sum of cubes then gives x+{{n}} and x^2-{{n}}x+{{n2}}."
        ],
        "answerSummary": "Repair to (x+{{c}})(x^3+{{n3}}), then use the sum-of-cubes factors."
